# ESLint bulk-suppressions tooling regenerates this as an empty `{}` for a
# workspace with nothing to suppress, and committing/deleting it is an endless
# loop. @lcabrera/tsconfig is public-facing and suppression-free by construction
# (AGENTS.md §4) — CI checks out no file, so any real finding fails the gate.
# Never un-ignore this or commit a non-empty one.
#
# It carries a second weight here: this package DEFINES the strictness every
# workspace is held to. A suppression in it would be the standard exempting
# itself from the standard.
eslint-suppressions.json
